+The `status.CODE` value of `0` is designated as the reset default. If a value of
+`0` is returned in response to a command execution, the command should be
+considered to have failed for UNSPECIFIED reasons. It is recommended that this
+status code be returned only if all other defined status codes are determined to
+be inapplicable.
